pe as a column in the index rather than as a directory level. That way the in=
dex does the sorting and nobody has to guess whether an extension letter live=
s with notes or with amendments.

The counter-argument is that counsel will want to pull all the SAFEs at once.=
 I think that is what the index filter is for.

